10	 * responding 409. The household is keyed on (lastName, postcode), so its deterministic
11	 * {@code householdId} (see {@link OwnerHousehold}) is shared by every owner with the same last
12	 * name and postcode; if any existing owner already carries that householdId, this request is a
13	 * household duplicate.
